main.go is the unchanged upstream standard entry point, including time/tzdata
and modules/standard. This is a Copper rebuild, not the upstream release binary.
The compiler is Go 1.27.3. go.mod/go.sum lock the complete module graph,
including the security override golang.org/x/net v0.60.0. The resolved graph
also uses github.com/klauspost/compress v1.20.1, golang.org/x/text v0.42.0,
golang.org/x/crypto v0.57.0 and google.golang.org/grpc v1.83.2.

The build verifies the module cache and uses -mod=readonly, CGO_ENABLED=0 and
GOTOOLCHAIN=local. The custom version explicitly identifies this modified build.
